{"synopsis":"Do Kyunwoo adalah seorang domba hitam dari keluarga pendekar pedang tersohor Bahkan dia tidak mampu memburu kelinci Di hari pertama saat memasuki kelas 5 dia bertemu dengan murid pindahan dan mengingat kehidupannya yang lalu\nDia telah bereinkarnasi ke dalam dunia game yang pernah dia mainkan bernama Brave Hearts Dia sudah pusing karena bereinkarnasi sebagai karakter cupu ditambah dengan murid pindahan itu adalah calon boss level menengah yang ditakdirkan untuk menghancurkan dunia\n Kenapa kamu baik kepadaku\n Karena aku ingin berteman denganmu\nDo Kyunwoo berencana untuk berteman dengan murid pindahan itu demi mencegah kehancuran dunia\nAgar dapat bertahan hidup di dunia ini dan mencapai ending yang dia dambakan\nDia menjadi sahabat dari boss level menengah","alternative_title":"중간 보스의 소꿉친구가 되었다","author":"Siyoon, Yeon","artist":"Yujeong","chapters":[{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"55969404-7321-495e-8aa1-cdc137d6fea5","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"31563613-2021-464b-b790-564b055ea398","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"fb642e85-0c09-4331-abc0-efaf89d9f5c0","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"2ac73bda-100f-49ea-b7af-5a00d625e7cd","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"b7050c32-4d99-477c-9f0e-b44c4069b8a8","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"884468fc-bccc-4f81-aeba-6c3a525a78b1","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"6260d383-6c90-4e57-968f-41a65ac2daa1","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"bc874880-3304-453a-8253-2edd46b338bc","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"77969044-b086-483d-94b4-b1db12ada4ee","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"77538fd7-9bb6-4bd9-9cab-3730768b41ad","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","sl